  "description": "Skaters line up in the corner. One at a time, skate along the boards and around the outside of the first face-off circle, cut across the slot and around the outside of the second circle, like a figure 8. Keep going down the far boards past the blue line and swing back around the face-off dot. The coach passes you a puck; skate in through the slot and shoot. The next skater goes when the one ahead reaches the second circle, so skaters cross in the slot.",
